      "en": "You are the most excellent of the sons of men. Grace has anointed your lips, therefore God has blessed you forever.",
      "ko": "왕은 인생보다 아름다워 은혜를 입술에 머금으니 그러므로 하나님이 왕에게 영영히 복을 주시도다",
      "source_text_hash": "720e34faac0e3ab19f62d9f1ca3504db23e997c554a707acd7b400be4f95bb9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "511aebfa437f0c204097b4e5171a27a5a1b6927c5939564dba46c4e1422de251",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
